<p style="text-align: center;">Gadget (Blue), Bailey (Lavender) and Nikki (Ochre), 11x14 oil on linen. 2013.</p>
<p>I painted these three papillons with different color backgrounds because they will be hung next to each other on the same wall. &nbsp;I wanted to make the arrangement of the portraits an artistic display in its own right. &nbsp;There will eventually be another two portraits that make up this set.</p>
<p>When painting portraits of several people/pets in the same commission it is always a challenge to create a consistent look and feel across the set. To help mitigate this, I worked on the design and block-in of the three portraits at the same time.</p>